{
  "name": "@studio-engine/editor-brain",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "AI editor brain: script + voice + assets \u2192 editorial analysis \u2192 story structure \u2192 ShotPlan v2, following VIDEO_EDITING_BIBLE.md. Deterministic core; the LLM layer plugs into its analysis.",
